# Testman's 5a gatlings into 5b in 5a's hitstun: the counter shows a 2-hit combo, without the combo limits module.
setup: module gatlings
setup: p1 character testman
setup: p2 character testman
setup: p1 x = -30000
setup: p2 x = 30000
frame 1: p1 5a
frame 14: p1 5b

frame 5: expect p2 combo = 1
frame 30: expect p2 combo = 2
